  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "運算思維與 PYTHON 程式設計",
    "sub_ename": "COMPUTATIONAL THINKING AND PYTHON PROGRAMMING",
    "describe_ch": "Python是目前最廣泛被使用的語言之一，除了設計簡潔、語法易讀易懂、學習曲線相對較低的優點以外，它可以應用於各種不同的領域，包括科學、數據分析、人工智能、網路開發等。本課程透過線上非同步的方式來講授課程，除了可以讓學生有彈性的時間空間進行學習外，也可以反覆的複習，並結合AI助教，提供24小時的學習輔助。課程主要範圍包含：Python程式語言簡介; 程式的基本結構與運算; 邏輯運算; 集合物件; 函式; 資料處理等。",
    "describe_eh": "Python is one of the most widely used programming languages today. In addition to its clean design, readable syntax, and relatively gentle learning curve, Python can be applied across a variety of domains, including scientific computing, data analysis, artificial intelligence, and web development.\nThis course is delivered asynchronously online, providing students with flexible access to learning materials anytime and anywhere. The format also allows for repeated review of content. Additionally, the course integrates AI-assisted support, offering 24/7 learning assistance.\nThe main topics of this course include an introduction to the Python programming language, the basic structure and operations of programs, logical operations, collection objects, functions, and data processing.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 1.0
  },
